WEBVTT

1
00:00:09,620 --> 00:00:18,600
Let's have breakfast here before I go

2
00:00:18,600 --> 00:00:19,800
What is this?

3
00:00:19,800 --> 00:00:21,300
This is called an electric bicycle

4
00:00:21,300 --> 00:00:24,500
It's just electricity, no need to refuel. It's just electricity.

5
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:26,100
Look, the whole city is lit up now

6
00:00:26,100 --> 00:00:28,000
That's how it lights up by generating electricity.

7
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:29,600
I also charge this thing.

8
00:00:29,600 --> 00:00:31,400
But it’s nothing compared to our motorcycles.

9
00:00:31,400 --> 00:00:32,800
It doesn't last that long

10
00:00:32,800 --> 00:00:34,700
At the same time, its speed is not that fast

11
00:00:34,700 --> 00:00:36,100
If you want to use it in the countryside,

12
00:00:36,100 --> 00:00:37,600
It's better to use a motorcycle

13
00:00:37,600 --> 00:00:40,900
The people in this world are so wonderful

14
00:00:40,900 --> 00:00:43,100
There are some that use oil and some that use electricity.

15
00:00:43,100 --> 00:00:44,300
Did you do anything today?

16
00:00:44,300 --> 00:00:45,800
Nothing to order today

17
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:47,600
I waited there all day and nothing happened

18
00:00:47,600 --> 00:00:50,100
So I went to reduce garbage and reduce garbage in the afternoon.

19
00:00:50,100 --> 00:00:52,900
Yes, it’s only these days to reduce garbage, Brother Xiao.

20
00:00:52,900 --> 00:00:54,700
I went to work with you and took on a lot of work

21
00:00:54,700 --> 00:00:56,200
And I make a lot of money from every order.

22
00:00:56,200 --> 00:00:57,600
Actually, before I did it with you

23
00:00:57,600 --> 00:00:59,600
It’s not that easy for us to do this daily work.
